      ],
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:explanation_of_concept_of_inapplicability": "Personal data whose processing is regulated in specialized regulations of equal or higher hierarchy in matters of risk management for natural disasters; and, security and defense of the State, in any of these cases must comply with international standards in the field of human rights and the principles of this Law, and at least with the criteria of legality, proportionality and necessity."
    },
