      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:treatment_suceptible_information": [
        "In the case of public servants, the historical and updated information of their asset declaration and remuneration shall be submitted for processing.",
        "Personal data concerning the contact of professionals and commercial data",
        "Representatives, partners and shareholders of legal entities, as well as public servants, may be subject to the processing of personal data in the context of their professional practice, line of business, competencies, powers, attributions or positions. This processing refers specifically to information such as names and surnames, functions or positions held, postal or e-mail addresses and professional telephone numbers."
