      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:data_subjects_to_treatment_according_to_the_right_to_not_be_the_object_of_automated_decisions": "When the processing is necessary to protect an essential public interest, as assessed according to international human rights standards, and meets at least the minimum criteria",
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description": "Refers to information specific or linked to certain sensitive or particular categories of a person.",
