      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:in_case_of_no_direct_obtaining_by_the_owner": "The holder shall be informed within thirty (30) days or at the time of the first communication with the holder.",
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:in_case_of_suspension_of_treatment_must_resort_to": {
