      },
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:in_cases_of_automated_evaluations": [
        "You may challenge automated decisions regarding the data subject's data before the data controller.",
        "You may request from the controller a detailed and reasoned explanation of the decision taken regarding the processing of your personal data.",
        "You may request from the data controller information on the types of data used and the source from which the data was obtained.",
        "You may request the evaluation criteria on the automated program.",
        "You may submit comments on the processing of your personal data."
      ],
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:obtaining_personal_data_directly_by_the_owner": "Information on how such data will be used must be provided to the data subject prior to collection, i.e., at the time the personal data is requested or collected from the data subject.",
