      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:description_responsible_for_channeling_exercise_of_rights": "It involves consideration of the individuals responsible for ensuring that the rights of the holder are properly exercised.",
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:irrevocability": "The holder's rights are non-transferable and cannot be waived; therefore, any clause or provision that contradicts this will be considered null and void.",
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:limitation_on_exercise_of_rights_by_secondary_laws": "Regulations or rules complementary to the Personal Data Protection Law may not restrict or limit the rights of the owner.",
