        "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:Scope_of_application"
      ],
      "ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales:scope_of_legislation": "The law will apply to the processing of personal data regardless of the medium in which it is stored, whether in automated or non-automated formats. This implies that the law is equally applicable to data stored in automated systems, such as electronic databases, as well as to data that may exist in non-automated formats, such as physical documents or paper files."
    },
